Trimmed real data (ruling T1). http/fonts.json and snapshot/fonts.json are 16 of
the 72 entries of Nerd Fonts' bin/scripts/lib/fonts.json at commit
64a084f95480ee5efb62132c01cd142ab6147655 (2026-09-01), unchanged apart from the
entries left out:
https://github.com/ryanoasis/nerd-fonts/blob/64a084f95480ee5efb62132c01cd142ab6147655/bin/scripts/lib/fonts.json

http/commits.json keeps only the sha and commit time of that commit from the
GitHub API's answer (no names or emails). The ETags in http/index.json are
invented.

http/tree.json is GitHub's git trees answer for src/unpatched-fonts at that
commit (recursive), trimmed to the folders of those 16 entries: their
sub-folders, preview font files and license, read-me and copyright files
(86 of 1,182 entries; file paths and blob hashes only). snapshot/licenses.json
is what the collector keeps of it.

